斗动作残影），景深效果（聚焦缠斗主体，背景古刹虚化），漫反射光影（洞穴低光环境自然亮度），烟雾粒子物理特效，IMAX 70mm胶片质感，史诗般宏大尺度，强烈明暗对比，诗意留白构图\",\n  \"negative_prompt\": \"卡通化，动漫风，高饱和艳俗色彩，西方奇幻元素，现代建筑，模糊纹理，线条杂乱，无传统纹样，扁平化，低细节，文字水印，比例失调，低分辨率，噪点严重，光影生硬，无反射效果，材质塑料感，色彩失真，jpeg artifacts，过曝/欠曝，无空间层次感\"\n}"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 5, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [646.5565795898438, 677.6253662109375], "pos": [1663.4742431640625, 398.3333740234375], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 1, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "id": 1, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [1], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "image_url", "label": "image_url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_url"}, {"name": "response", "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "size": [455.1892395019531, 412], "pos": [1159.373291015625, 392.5771484375], "widgets_values": ["", 1709877999, "randomize", "16:9", "2k", false, "Third-party"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 2, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 3, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "n